'''Miyabi Oyama''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 6.8 increases health, attack power, backswing length and gains [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 395
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Miyabi Oyama
|name2 = Miyabi Oyama CC
|name3 = Baseball Mask δ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Miyabi Oyama CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Baseball Mask δ''' using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Miyabi can be used as a ranged fighter when you don't know what else to use. Her [[Strengthen]] ability makes her able to destroy enemy melee/peon units, as well as wave enemies. She can be used on [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]] in her True Form. Otherwise, you should use her as a fighter, as you would [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

